#====================================================================
# E321 draft — CMake archive without install() or CTest entries
#====================================================================

id:                     E321
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|ctest|clang
phase:                  configuration|packaging|testing
error_signature:        Compatibility with CMake < 3.5 has been removed|No tests were found|install.*rule.*not found|missing.*config_impl.hpp

severity:               2
category:               build-system, cmake, conan, packaging, testing
match_keywords:         CMake 4, CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM, no install rules, no add_test, generated config header, explicit package staging, ctest
title:                  CMake 旧归档无 install/CTest 时的显式制品收集与诚实测试记录

root_cause:             部分老 CMake 归档只定义库和示例目标，没有 install() 规则或 enable_testing()/add_test()；同时生成的公共配置头只存在于构建目录。现代 CMake 4 还会拒绝低于 3.5 的 cmake_minimum_required，导致直接配置失败。仅依赖 cmake.install() 会得到空包，或把 ctest 的 No tests were found 误报成上游测试通过。
affected_scope:         使用旧版 CMake、无安装规则或无 CTest 用例的 Conan C/C++ 库；尤其是带 configure_file 生成公共头且需要保留官方示例 smoke test 的静态库适配。
verification_cmd:       cmake -S <src> -B <build> -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 && cmake --build <build> -- -j1 && ctest --test-dir <build> --output-on-failure; then inspect the package and run a real consumer

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           explicit-policy-and-artifact-staging
rec_description:        在 Conan CMakeToolchain 中设置 CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5；先构建并直接运行 ctest，明确记录零 CTest 用例，再从源目录、构建目录和正式构建产物位置显式收集头文件、生成头、许可证和库，并用消费者测试验证真实 API。
rec_command:            cmake -S <src> -B <build> -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 && cmake --build <build> -- -j1 && ctest --test-dir <build> --output-on-failure
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-recipe

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      upstream-install-rule
fallback_description:   若上游后续提供稳定 install() 规则，可优先核对其安装清单并复用；仍需确认生成公共头和测试入口覆盖。
fallback_command:       cmake --install <build> --prefix <staging>
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          manual

forbid_1_pattern:       claim.*upstream.*tests.*pass.*No tests were found|cmake\.install\(\).*without.*install|copy.*source.*headers.*only
forbid_1_reason:        ctest 零用例不是通过了上游断言；缺少 install() 时 cmake.install() 不能替代显式 package()；只复制源码头还会漏掉构建生成的公共头。
forbid_1_consequence:   PR 会虚报测试覆盖或产出缺少配置头的不可消费包，失败被推迟到下游编译阶段。

principles:             P010, P014
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             [E187, E301, E309]
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

